OL,3,GNEWSAReform Wales leader backs
OL,4,Apolitician who said white people are
OL,5,Abeing replaced
OL,6,
OL,7,FReform's leader in Wales says she
OL,8,Fstands "firmly" by one of her Senedd
OL,9,Fmembers who was banned from speaking in
OL,10,Fthe parliament for claiming white
OL,11,Fpeople are being "replaced" in the UK.
OL,13,FHelen Jenner said Members of the Senedd
OL,14,F(MSs) should not be "silenced" after
OL,15,FJoe Martin was told he would not be
OL,16,Fallowed to speak in the chamber until
OL,17,Fhe apologises.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,433,430,260,140,0,100
