OL,3,GNEWSAReform Wales leader backs
OL,4,Apolitician who said white people are
OL,5,Abeing replaced
OL,6,
OL,7,FOn Tuesday the Senedd's Presiding
OL,8,FOfficer Huw Irranca-Davies said
OL,9,FMartin's remarks were "unnecessarily
OL,10,Fprovocative and deliberately
OL,11,Foffensive".
OL,13,FIn a statement on social media on
OL,14,FWednesday morning, Jenner said:
OL,15,F"Whatever your political views, nobody
OL,16,Felected to the Senedd should be
OL,17,Fsilenced simply because others disagree
OL,18,Fwith what they have to say."
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
